X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_317080295@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261107T055533Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T210000
SUMMARY:Tichu Tuesday
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Join us at Gamers Geekery & T
 avern for a friendly\, competitive game of Tichu.**\n\n**For those interes
 ted in learning the game we'll have a teaching session from 6 - 6:30.**\n\
 n**We'll move to partners and scoring at 6:30.**\n\nPrimarily classified a
 s a shedding game that includes elements of Bridge\, Daihinmin\, and Poker
 \, Tichu is played between two teams of two players each. Special cards\, 
 the Dragon and Phoenix have special powers and there are tons of strategy 
 decisions to make.\n\n**Venue fee $2.50/person. Please support our host ve
 nue by purchasing food and beverage.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 317080295/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261021T222032Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T222032Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Triangle Board Games & Bars
UID:event_317109445@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
